1vu9|n|That branch of philosophy which treats of the constitution, phenomena, and development of human society; social science.	a:1s99,2,1~1s99,2,1	V:izx,38,6~izx,38,6	n:1mlq,79,10;my4,77,6~1mlq,79,10;my4,77,6	N:my4,77,6;ii9,33,4;1luo,25,4;g8r,16,2~my4,77,6;ii9,33,4;1luo,25,4;g8r,16,2
